WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.849
JUDGE RENSLAYER
Loki Laufeyson...

00:00:02.849 --> 00:00:04.516
I sentence you to be reset.

00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:06.389
LOKI
You ridiculous bureaucrats

00:00:06.389 --> 00:00:08.611
will not dictate
how my story ends!

00:00:08.611 --> 00:00:10.619
JUDGE RENSLAYER
It's not your story, Mr. Laufeyson.

00:00:10.619 --> 00:00:12.222
It never was.

00:00:14.513 --> 00:00:17.156
GUGU MBATHA-RAW
Renslayer works for the TVA,

00:00:17.172 --> 00:00:22.940
this bureau that really
maintains the integrity of time.

00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:26.757
JUDGE RENSLAYER
If anything goes sideways, it's on you.

00:00:26.757 --> 00:00:28.479
MOBIUS
I feel like I'm always looking up to you.

00:00:28.479 --> 00:00:29.512
It's appropriate.

00:00:30.122 --> 00:00:31.598
GUGU MBATHA-RAW
She's powerful.

00:00:32.146 --> 00:00:33.617
She's well-respected.

00:00:34.384 --> 00:00:36.685
TOM HIDDLESTON
She has enormous authority.

00:00:36.685 --> 00:00:38.050
KATE HERRON
She's someone that has worked her way

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:41.375
up the ranks. I think
Gugu really captured that journey.

00:00:41.375 --> 00:00:42.375
MOBIUS
Why do you get to keep

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:44.137
all the trophies
from my cases?

00:00:44.137 --> 00:00:46.010
JUDGE RENSLAYER
Because I approve the missions.

00:00:46.035 --> 00:00:46.717
MOBIUS
Good point.

00:00:46.717 --> 00:00:48.598
GUGU MBATHA-RAW
There's a lot of betrayal and mischief.

00:00:48.598 --> 00:00:49.645
It's really wonderful.

00:00:49.645 --> 00:00:50.613
JUDGE RENSLAYER
Cheers.

00:00:50.613 --> 00:00:53.804
GUGU MBATHA-RAW
I'm excited to watch the show myself!

